   "id": "bava_batra.69a.5",
   "daf": "69a",
   "sentenceId": 4,
   "he": "וְאֶת הַתְּבוּאָה הַמְחוּבֶּרֶת לַקַּרְקַע וְכוּ׳. וְאַף עַל גַּב דִּמְטַאי לְמִיחְצַד. וְאֶת חִיצַת הַקָּנִים שֶׁפְּחוּתָה מִבֵּית רוֹבַע. וְאַף עַל גַּב דְּאַלִּימִי.",
   "en": "The Gemara continues expounding the mishna, which includes among the components that are sold with a field «the produce that is» still «attached to the ground.» The Gemara comments: «Even though» the time «has» already «come» for the produce «to be cut down,» it is included in the sale since it is still attached to the ground. The mishna also includes among the things that are sold with a field «the cluster of reeds that» occupy «less than a beit rova.» The Gemara notes: «Even though» these reeds «are thick,» they are still classified as part of the field."
  }
 ],
